    lambdaber:description "Lambda-ber-schema record for the anonymised SerialEM single-particle session in tests/data/raw/emsl-serialem-krios/, built from its metadata.yaml acquisition sheet and mdoc sidecars. The RO-Crate in that directory is the manifest view of the same session." ;
